        "system": {
          "actionType": {
            "value": "action"
          },
          "actions": {
            "value": 1
          },
          "category": "ancestry",
          "description": {
            "value": "<p>You don't always have time to wait for your allies to make room, so it's best to politely move them yourself. Attempt an Athletics check to @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.actionspf2e.Item.Shove] an ally. You don't need to have a free hand to attempt this check. If your ally is willing, treat the result as one degree of success higher.</p>"
          },
          "level": {
            "value": 1
          },
          "prerequisites": {
